{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-08", "pageid": 134680, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-07\" title=\"春日迟-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BA.8C.E7.99.BE.E6.98.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"二百春\">二百春</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 二百春</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Two Hundred Springs</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_07\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_4_at_07.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_4_at_07.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_4_at_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>——花开了，花真的开了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-623401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老丈：</div><div>我这就去镇上打二两好酒，你们等我回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>哎，哎——老丈！老丈！不用破费了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>等了这么多年的杏花，老丈才看了两眼，怎么就走了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这有什么，未来的时间还很长嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>未来的时间？可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措的声音低了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>可是老丈已经年近八旬了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>没什么，我是说，太阳快要下山了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>趁着日头还在，休息休息吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她顺势懒洋洋地躺倒在嫩绿的草地上，阿措也在她身边坐下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你之后打算去哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不知道，四处游历吧。涣州的事我已经托付给朋友，也是时候去别处看看了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你呢，阿措？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>或许回家一趟？我要学的还有很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>其实……我是偷偷跑出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我就说嘛。你才多大，家中长辈定然是不放心的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她随意拨弄着新长出的小草，草叶轻轻顶着她的指尖，仿佛还在继续生长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，我还有个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯，你问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你……是不是活了很久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你一路上提到的那些风物，都是过去的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>涣州有仙人祛灾的传闻，也是近两百年前……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>抱歉，如果不方便，你就当我没问吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风吹起鹭鸶剪鬓角的头发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没什么不方便的，确实如此。你好聪明！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不过这并非我的本意……说来有点复杂，你就当我和老丈的那棵杏花树一样，是生了一场大病吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>那……活了这么久，是什么感觉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我想想啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没什么特别的感觉。生病久了，也就觉不出自己在病中了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>为什么说是生病呢？多少人做梦都想长生。哪怕话本小说里，修道之人所求也不外乎此……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你也知道那是话本啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>咳咳……你读的都是什么本子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>《葛天氏外传》《白马真人悬壶记》，还有《三秋梦录平话》……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>看来两百年过去，《葛天氏外传》卖得依旧很好嘛。我记得里面有个凡人向葛天氏求道，下山后发现人间已经过了千年的故事，是不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>那些受人欢迎的长生故事，或是仙人眷红尘，或是凡客慕玉京，说到底，讲的都是有所不能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>从前师姐和我说，随着人的年岁渐长，时间的流动也会越来越快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我当时没有反驳，但心里很不以为然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>十多岁的时候，花开花落是为一季；等到十几年后、几十年后，一季的时间，不也同样是从花开等到花谢吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>但现在看来，她说得对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>第一个十年，一切都过得好慢……但第二个十年就没那么难熬了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>再往后……日子总会慢慢过去的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措望着天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>嗯……我不太懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我马上就十七岁了，这是我见过的第十七个春天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你见过多少个春天呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这我可记不清，你的问题好难啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>咴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处，原本低头吃草的骡子不知看到了什么，忽地长嘶一声，向远处跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我去把它追回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>无妨，它跑得不快，慢些跟上去也来得及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>何况它既然认路，或许过一会儿就自己回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>不成，我答应的事就一定要做到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？你答应什么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>今日初见时我说，倘若有什么能帮上你的，义不容辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>当时我想不到能做什么……不过，把你的骡子找回来还是可以的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我的骡子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她略微有些吃惊，支起胳膊看着年轻的修道者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>对啊！这骡子该送给解决气凝之事……不，是救活了杏花树的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>所以，它现在是你的骡子了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>也好，那我游历时也算是有个同行的朋友了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>这骡子虽然走不快，但好在你也不赶时间嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说话间，骡子的声音越来越远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我得去看看，你就在这儿等着我，好不好？我马上就回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好啊，那你可要快些。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_072.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_072\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_072\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-3_4_at_072.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_072.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-3_4_at_072.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_072.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/Cg-3_4_at_072.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_072.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪重新躺下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草叶摇晃声渐渐远去。阳光确乎极好，她闭上眼睛，有些困倦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>十七岁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我跟着师姐下山那年，也是十七岁吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道人耳畔响起一阵莎莎声。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_071.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_071\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_071\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-3_4_at_071.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_071.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-3_4_at_071.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_071.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-3_4_at_071.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_071.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>——咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？你怎么回来了？只有你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸手戳了戳骡子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骡子不理不睬，抖了抖耳朵，自顾自行到树下啃食新草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>正好，你也来帮我想想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>究竟是多少个春天呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>究竟是多少个春天呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>春风吹拂，春草摇曳，骡子也不知道答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两百个春天吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二十多个春天吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个春天吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还是说，她已经失去了所有的春天？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>师父，我昨日想了很久……您还是不要对她过于严苛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我们总会离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>在此之后，她还要一个人走很远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>她或许会很孤独的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-08"}}